    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanization is a factory building game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your factory from the ground up, utilizing an array of droppers, conveyor belts, smelters, upgraders and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unveil new items via the tech tree using research points, gained from creating production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your land to accommodate an ever-growing assembly of production facilities and add factory modules to enhance your factory's efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Resource droppers that drop ores </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Smelters that smelt and sell ores </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tech Tree system for balanced progression </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Conveyor belts that transport ores around your factory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgraders that attach to conveyors and upgrade ore that pass through it </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Factory modules that can enhance your factory's efficiency </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanization is a factory building game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your factory from the ground up, utilizing an array of droppers, conveyor belts, smelters, upgraders and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unveil new items via the tech tree using research points, gained from creating production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your land to accommodate an ever-growing assembly of production facilities and add factory modules to enhance your factory's efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Resource droppers that drop ores </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Smelters that smelt and sell ores </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tech Tree system for balanced progression </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Conveyor belts that transport ores around your factory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgraders that attach to conveyors and upgrade ore that pass through it </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Factory modules that can enhance your factory's efficiency </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mechanization is a factory building game. Build huge production lines, utilizing an array of droppers, conveyor belts, smelters, upgraders &amp; more! Upgrade the size of your factory &amp; use factory modules to enhance your factory's efficiency.",
